{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d35d95cb-2adb-80fe-aaa7-e91ae6385914",
  "created_at": "2026-02-07T10:57:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello, is this, um, am I getting the right place? I know City Hall's closed, it's Saturday, but the recording said to call this number for snow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. The storm line stays open when the office is closed. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My street hasn't been plowed. Not once since the storm. Not one time. [pause] Hold on, I'm putting something down here. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's been days, and it's wicked cold out, everything's frozen solid. We got a little dusting overnight on top of it, so now it's just a sheet of ice with powder on it. Nobody's come down here. Nobody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:04-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm writing that down. Street not plowed since the storm, ice underneath, light dusting on top. What's the street name and closest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Um, I'd rather not, I'm just, I want somebody to put it in the log. That it was reported. That I called. You can log it, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can log the call, sure. Without a street the crew's not going to know where to go, though. Would you want to give me just the street, no number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hang on, the TV's on, the golf, the replay of the tournament, sound's off, I'm not even watching it, I just, anyway. No. Just log it. I called, it's not plowed. That's what I want on the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I've got it logged as a Saturday morning call, unplowed street since the storm, caller frustrated. I'll flag it for the crew supervisor first thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First thing, okay. Because this is, it's too long already. Fine. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-07T10:57:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Stay warm, Mr. Abdi."
    }
  ],
